{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股今早窄幅上落，恒生指數半日高低點數波幅約210點，中午收市報23180點，跌31點，主板半日成交887億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n金融股支撐大市，滙控中午公布季度業績前半日升近1%，友邦保險升逾2%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n地產分類指數跌1%，其中新世界發展跌逾2%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技股亦受壓，科技指數中午收市報3827點，跌幅約0.8%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李意琴\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:20.199579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:15:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:49.826360+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:57.505275+00:00","content_hash":"a39d6393223068a4eb21d39c097a0f83a5ea80aec9e7c3201cff2150f12478e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}